# The build context is the repository root, because a service is a package in
# this module and the build needs the module. Everything a build cannot use is
# excluded here, so a run's output never ships inside an image.
#
# Hidden paths are excluded as a class rather than named: no build reads one,
# and enumerating them would put the name of somebody's local tooling in a
# tracked file.
.*
reports
bin
dist
docs
attacks
scenarios
trajectories
examples
*.md
